WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.102
Use this decision guide when designing modular SQL
Choose a CTE

00:00:06.115 --> 00:00:11.789
for statement-local stages Choose a standard view
for stable shared live

00:00:11.815 --> 00:00:17.385
logic Use a simple updatable view only when write
behavior is

00:00:17.412 --> 00:00:23.371
intentional Use views with proper privileges for
controlled interfaces

00:00:25.106 --> 00:00:32.069
Choose a materialized view when storing a reusable
result is worth the freshness tradeoff Keep

00:00:32.095 --> 00:00:35.700
highly changeable report thresholds outside stable
shared objects
